DESCRIPTION:Come on down and join us for our weekly Open Mic Night! Every W
 ednesday from 6pm we provide a full PA\, drum kit and electric piano.You b
 ring your own instruments\, tunes\, jokes\, poems\, dance shoes\, props\, 
 whips\, leads and guitar amps.Full bands welcome.We don't use a chalk boar
 d so if you want to play\, say hello when you arrive\, and we will sort ou
 t a spot.Banshees is a 'Sweet Home Alabama' and 'Mustang Sally' free zone.
  These songs have been played way too often at open mics and need to make 
 way for other songs. Riptide is on thin ice.
